  "implementation": [
    "Page scope lives in the existing RuntimeSession and is minted only by explicit login browser admission. Parent normal completion retains a nonawait page; explicit cancellation/session/page close seals and drains it. No new VM, HTTP transport, credential owner or backing cache.",
    "Exact JS_INJECTION2 template aliases/request/callback-cache discipline; explicit GET empty still receives injection. POST replaces prepared HTML once without reinjection; present empty has no WebJS bridge. Awaittrue reuses present prepared body; false retains existing DOM/URL reply.",
    "One retained page AnalyzeRule with null Book/Chapter. Cancellable per-page Mutex serializes parser state; child runs on a distinct existing worker context, rejecting synchronous Rhino reentry. Production platform and persistence dynamically route to that child RuntimeTask while retaining same session HTTP/Cookie/cache owner.",
    "Synchronous finite Java/cache and request(run/three already implemented helpers) return typed String/null/list/void. Async run null stringifies to literal null; direct cache missing remains true null; result lives only in existing RuleCache memory until JS2 consume/delete.",
    "Single deadline timer handler seals and cancels only. Worker explicit close sends native cancellation then awaits issued child completion. Cancelled producer worker drains before terminal effect snapshot, including accepted ACK arriving after cancellation; finally also closes a late-cancelled producer. Bounded child facts merge into the still registered parent; a completed parent terminal is immutable."
  ],
  "actualVectors": [
    "Public legacy+V2 explicitHTML; correct head insertion and empty GET preparation; POST once+replacement+empty-no-bridge; awaittrue body reuse and empty terminal failure.",
    "Same session page survives nonawait producer completion; source variable/cache persistence and memory delete/read; retained AnalyzeRule content across requests; actual JSONPath; null Book/Chapter; run literal null and original script-error callback.",
    "Parent source.browser Host callback remains blocked while independent child succeeds on same session; synchronous parent Rhino reentry rejects; forged/cross-session/closed page rejects; unsupported extra method rejects.",
    "Actual loopback GET via same JVM HTTP, source Header and Cookie owner; no genericHTTPHost or credential store access.",
    "Close waits an actually accepted state.commit Host callback, issues native task.cancel itself, preserves accepted effect on cancelled child, rejects late page work.",
    "Parent awaiting browser cancellation returns cancellation call without waiting for held child; parent worker then cancels/drains and rejects late write.",
    "Nonawait presented producer continues script then cancellation: same worker closes its page, waits accepted child callback, and its CANCELLED terminal preserves child StateCommitted facts.",
    "cache.get onlyDisk=true returns actual persistent disk value despite explicit different same-owner memory overlay; default/false retain memory priority.",
    "Original request accepts7 synthetic string params and truncates to original first6; callback result is consumed/deleted through existing memory."
  ],
